Subject: [PATCH] fix: make locked portrait visible and downloadable
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Step 2 locked identity banner: enlarge reference image (72→80px),
  add '↓ Save' overlay and 'View full size' button to always access
  the locked master portrait
- Step 5 post-generation: show portrait download row with thumbnail
  and '↓ Save portrait' button after every video completes
- Add viewLockedPortrait() — opens fal CDN URL in new tab
- Add downloadLockedPortrait() — downloads master portrait URL
- Add downloadPortraitUsed() — downloads the portrait that was sent
  to the video pipeline (object URL from S.portraitFile)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ms6XhBCwEJ8HKRuTQiTHFS
